{"seq":3,"slug":"reranking-in-rag","title":"RAG 中的重排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/practice/reranking-in-rag","wordCount":1415,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"rag-中的重排\">RAG 中的重排</h1><p>重排器最常见的落地场景就是 RAG（检索增强生成）。RAG 的链路是「检索文档 → 塞进提示 → 让 LLM 生成答案」，而生成质量的天花板被塞进去的文档质量死死卡住——喂了不相关或排序混乱的文档，再强的 LLM 也只能生成平庸甚至幻觉的答案。重排器正是夹在「检索」和「塞进提示」之间那一道精排闸门。本篇讲它在 RAG 里的确切位置、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 怎么联动调、以及什么时候它的增益不值那点延迟。更广的 RAG 工程链路（切块、向量库）属兄弟 hub 08，本篇只聚焦重排这一环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-重排在-rag-链路的位置\">核心概念：重排在 RAG 链路的位置</h2><p>RAG 的标准链路里，重排是检索之后、组装上下文之前的一步。它把召回的一大堆候选精排，只把最相关的几条交给 LLM。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Q[用户问题] --&gt; RET[检索 召回 N 条&lt;br/&gt;向量 + BM25 混合]&#10;  RET --&gt; RR[重排器精排&lt;br/&gt;交叉编码器/LLM]&#10;  RR --&gt; TOPK[取 Top-k 最相关]&#10;  TOPK --&gt; CTX[组装上下文&lt;br/&gt;填进提示模板]&#10;  CTX --&gt; LLM[生成模型作答]&#10;  LLM --&gt; ANS[答案]\">flowchart TD\n  Q[用户问题] --&gt; RET[检索 召回 N 条&lt;br/&gt;向量 + BM25 混合]\n  RET --&gt; RR[重排器精排&lt;br/&gt;交叉编码器/LLM]\n  RR --&gt; TOPK[取 Top-k 最相关]\n  TOPK --&gt; CTX[组装上下文&lt;br/&gt;填进提示模板]\n  CTX --&gt; LLM[生成模型作答]\n  LLM --&gt; ANS[答案]</pre><p>为什么 RAG 特别需要重排？因为 RAG 的瓶颈往往不在召回不到，而在召回到了却排在中段、被 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 截断挡在上下文之外，或排在上下文末尾被 LLM 忽视（长上下文的「中间遗忘」效应）。重排把真正相关的文档顶到前几位，直接抬高喂给 LLM 的上下文质量。这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/retrieve-then-rerank\">检索-重排两阶段</a> 漏斗在 RAG 里的具体化身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"n-与-k-的联动调参\">N 与 k 的联动调参</h2><p>RAG 里有两个串起来的旋钮：检索召回多少（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>）、重排后塞几条进上下文（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>）。它们必须一起调。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>（召回数）决定重排的「原料」。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 太小，正确文档可能根本没被召回，重排无力回天（受 Recall@N 上限锁死）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 太大，重排延迟和成本线性上涨（见 <a href=\"latency-cost-tradeoffs\">延迟与成本取舍</a>）。典型取值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=20\\sim100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>（上下文文档数）决定喂给 LLM 多少。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 太小，可能漏掉需要的信息（尤其多跳问题要综合多篇）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 太大，上下文变长——既增加 token 成本，又触发 LLM 的中间遗忘、稀释关键信息，反而可能降低答案质量。典型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=3\\sim10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>关键规律：有了好的重排器，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 可以更小。没有重排时为了不漏信息只能塞很多文档（大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>），祈祷答案在里面；重排把最相关的顶到前面后，小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 就能覆盖所需信息，于是上下文更短、更便宜、LLM 也更聚焦。这是重排在 RAG 里最实在的收益之一。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>旋钮</th>\n<th>太小</th>\n<th>太大</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 召回数</td>\n<td>漏召回、重排无米下锅</td>\n<td>重排延迟成本涨</td>\n<td>20~100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 上下文数</td>\n<td>漏信息、多跳答不全</td>\n<td>上下文长、中间遗忘、贵</td>\n<td>3~10</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>评测这套参数要用对指标：重排排序质量看 nDCG@k（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 取实际塞进上下文的数），端到端看答案质量（faithfulness、answer relevance）。指标定义见 <a href=\"reranking-evaluation\">评测 nDCG/MRR</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么时候重排不值得\">什么时候重排不值得</h2><p>重排不是 RAG 的必选项，盲目加会白白增加延迟和成本。几种重排增益小的情形要识别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>召回已经很准：若第一阶段（尤其混合检索）的 nDCG 已经很高、正确文档基本都在前几位，重排能提升的空间很小。</li>\n<li>候选间区分度低：候选文档都差不多相关（或都不相关），重排怎么排顺序对最终答案影响都不大。</li>\n<li>单文档就够答：简单事实问答只需一篇文档，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时重排只要把最相关那篇顶到第一即可，收益有限。</li>\n<li>延迟极敏感：对话式实时场景，重排那几十到几百毫秒可能拖垮体验，得权衡。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>判断方法：做消融——同一套测试问题，比较「有重排」和「无重排」的端到端答案质量（和 nDCG@k）。若提升微小，就别引入；若显著，再按 <a href=\"latency-cost-tradeoffs\">延迟与成本取舍</a> 选最划算的重排器。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[RAG 该不该加重排?] --&gt; B{召回 nDCG 已很高?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[增益小 可不加]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D{候选间有区分度?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| C&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[做消融 比有/无重排端到端质量]&#10;  E --&gt; F{提升显著?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[按延迟成本选重排器]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| C\">graph TD\n  A[RAG 该不该加重排?] --&gt; B{召回 nDCG 已很高?}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[增益小 可不加]\n  B --&gt;|否| D{候选间有区分度?}\n  D --&gt;|否| C\n  D --&gt;|是| E[做消融 比有/无重排端到端质量]\n  E --&gt; F{提升显著?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[按延迟成本选重排器]\n  F --&gt;|否| C</pre><h2 id=\"选哪类重排器进-rag\">选哪类重排器进 RAG</h2><p>回到第二章的三类模型，在 RAG 里怎么选？多数 RAG 系统用 <a href=\"../rerankers/cross-encoder-rerankers\">交叉编码器</a>——性价比基准线，BGE/Cohere/Voyage 直接接上即可，对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=20\\sim100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 的候选延迟可控。需要遵循复杂自然语言指令（「优先引用最新政策文件」）或追求精度上限、且能承受成本时，用 <a href=\"../rerankers/llm-rerankers\">LLM 重排器</a> 做最末一级精排。候选规模特别大时，<a href=\"../rerankers/colbert-late-interaction\">ColBERT 延迟交互</a> 兼顾可扩展与细粒度。常见的稳健配置：混合检索召回 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> → 交叉编码器重排 → 取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 进上下文。RAG 流水线里重排的工程接法、与切块和向量库的配合，见兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../rag-knowledge-systems/retrieval-pipeline/reranking-strategies\">重排策略</a> 与 <a href=\"../../rag-knowledge-systems/retrieval-pipeline/retrieval-ranking\">检索排序</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>重排是 RAG 里检索之后、组装上下文之前的精排闸门，把最相关文档顶到前面，直接抬高喂给 LLM 的上下文质量。</li>\n<li>RAG 瓶颈常是「召回到了却排在中段被截断、或排在末尾被中间遗忘」，重排正治这个病。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>（召回 20<del>100）与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>（上下文 3</del>10）联动调：有好重排器后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 可更小，上下文更短、更便宜、LLM 更聚焦。</li>\n<li>重排增益小的情形：召回已很准、候选区分度低、单文档够答、延迟极敏感——靠消融判断是否值得加。</li>\n<li>选型：多数用交叉编码器基准线，复杂指令/极致精度用 LLM 重排末级精排，超大候选用 ColBERT。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../foundations/retrieve-then-rerank\">检索-重排两阶段</a> —— RAG 里漏斗的总原理。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"latency-cost-tradeoffs\">延迟与成本取舍</a> —— RAG 重排的 ROI 与选型成本。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../rerankers/llm-rerankers\">LLM 重排器</a> —— 复杂指令场景的末级精排。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../rag-knowledge-systems/retrieval-pipeline/reranking-strategies\">重排策略</a> —— RAG 管线的重排工程接法。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../rag-knowledge-systems/rag-architecture/advanced-rag-pattern\">高级 RAG 模式</a> —— 重排所处的 RAG 架构全景。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RAG 中的重排","id":"rag-中的重排"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：重排在 RAG 链路的位置","id":"核心概念-重排在-rag-链路的位置"},{"level":2,"text":"N 与 k 的联动调参","id":"n-与-k-的联动调参"},{"level":2,"text":"什么时候重排不值得","id":"什么时候重排不值得"},{"level":2,"text":"选哪类重排器进 RAG","id":"选哪类重排器进-rag"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"延迟与成本取舍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/practice/latency-cost-tradeoffs"},"next":null}